  "translation": [
    "My name is Xiaoming. I'm twenty years old and a university student. I live alone now, and I cook for myself every day.",
    "Last year I couldn't cook, so I ate bread every day. My mother said, \"That's not good. You need to learn to cook for yourself.\"",
    "Today is Sunday. I went to the supermarket and bought fish and eggs. Cooking wasn't as tiring as I had thought. I called a friend: \"Can you come to my place for dinner?\"",
    "My friend came, saw the fish on the table, and said, \"Such delicious fish! Did you make it yourself?\" I said, \"Yes, I made it myself.\" He said, \"Do you cook like this every day?\" I said, \"No, I only cook like this on Sundays.\""
  ],
